           className={`font-sans font-semibold tracking-widest mt-1 ${sizeDimensions.fontSub}`}\n            style={{ color: subtitleColor, letterSpacing: \'0.22em\' }}\n          >\n            TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED\n          </span>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
    }
