\n            >\n              <span className=\"font-mono text-[9px] text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                {tech.category}\n              </span>\n              <p className=\"font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white tracking-wider mt-3 group-hover:text-neutral-200\">\n                {tech.name}\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n};\n"
    }
