  planner_response {
    response: "I have built a world-class personal portfolio website for **Hassan Abdulsatar Olamide**.\n\n### Key Features & Design System\n\n- **Editorial Technology Aesthetic**: Framed by a high-contrast dark canvas (`#0A0A0A` / `#121212`), high-density typography (Syne headings + Plus Jakarta Sans + Space Mono), grid layout structures, and generous whitespace.\n- **Brand System & Distinction**: Establishes **Hassan Abdulsatar Olamide** as a *Product Builder, Full-Stack Developer, and Founder*, while cleanly positioning **NAMACO TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED** as his umbrella technology brand identity rather than a portfolio project. Includes the official NAMACO logo mark.\n- **Editorial Navigation**: Refined sticky header navigation (`WORK`, `ABOUT`, `CAPABILITIES`, `CONTACT`, `LET\'S CONNECT`) with a slide-down mobile menu overlay.\n- **Hero & Positioning**: Oversized typography displaying Hassan\'s identity, primary headline *\"I build digital products that move ideas forward.\"*, supporting copy, and the transition section *\"From idea to interface to product.\"*\n- **Selected Work**: Case-study cards for Hassan\'s core products and platforms:\n  - **01 VEYRA** (`PRODUCT \302\267 PLATFORM \302\267 FULL-STACK`) \342\200\224 Positioned around team building and co-builder discovery (`https://vetra-waitlist-azure.vercel.app/`).\n  - **02 DOERLY** (`STARTUP \302\267 PLATFORM \302\267 PRODUCT`) \342\200\224 Creative execution platform (`https://doerlyai.vercel.app/`).\n  - **03 TAHAB HOTEL & SUITES** (`CLIENT WORK \302\267 HOSPITALITY`) \342\200\224 Hospitality web experience (`https://tahab-hotel-demo.netlify.app/`).\n  - **04 SPLIT & SETTLE** (`WEB APP \302\267 PRODUCT EXPERIMENT`) \342\200\224 Group expense settlement utility (`https://v0-problem-solving-ideas.vercel.app/`).\n- **Interactive Case Study Deep Dives**: Full modal breakdown covering all 11 lifecycle phases (Overview, Problem, Product Vision, UX, Design, Architecture, Auth, Database, Deployment, Challenges, and Lessons Learned) with architecture diagrams and defensible metrics.\n- **Client & Business Work**: Separate category highlighting commercial work for *Quafix Plugs, Adeshina Gadget, K-Tech, Aby Gadgets, Softy Gadgets,* and *Hibee Computer Technology* with verified roles and contributions.\n- **Interactive Project Filtering**: Filter tabs (`ALL`, `PRODUCTS`, `CLIENT WORK`, `WEB APPS`, `EXPERIMENTS`).\n- **About & Philosophy**: Features *\"Building from Africa, thinking globally.\"*, Hassan\'s founder statement, principles, and personal portrait presentation.\n- **What I Build & Technology Stack**: Highlights 5 core capabilities (*Product, Frontend, Backend, Full-Stack, Experiments*) and verified technology stack (HTML, CSS, JS, React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, Supabase, REST APIs, Auth, Git, GitHub, Vercel, Netlify).\n- **How I Build & Proof of Work**: Displays the 5-step engineering lifecycle (*Understand, Structure, Design, Build, Ship*) and an interactive code logic viewer showcasing real code snippets.\n- **Currently Building Spotlight**: Featured venture spotlight for Veyra under NAMACO.\n- **Contact & Footer**: Direct email (`olamideh825@gmail.com`), phone (`08051842700`), Instagram (`@namacotechnology`), primary mailto actions, interactive inquiry form, and footer copyright system."
    thinking: "**Verifying Prompt Mandates**\n\nI\'ve just confirmed the core `compile_applet` process worked flawlessly, no errors! Now, I\'m meticulously revisiting every prompt mandate and critical constraint to eliminate any possibility of overlooked details. The key identity information for Hassan Abdulsatar Olamide, including title and company, is still under review to ensure all elements are precisely rendered.\n\n\n**Refining Brand Identity**\n\nI\'m now integrating NAMACO\'s official brand elements, including the geometric \"N\" symbol, and the full name with \"TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED\". I\'ve finalized the core message: \"I don\'t just write code. I turn ideas into real digital products.\" Also, I\'ve defined the visual direction to be an editorial technology portfolio aesthetic with black, white, and subtle grays. Typography is set as Syne Display, Plus Jakarta Sans, and Space Mono.\n\n\n**Defining Portfolio Sections**\n\nI\'m now outlining key sections for my portfolio. I\'m focusing on defining a clear position, including a headline stating my process. I\'m building on the idea of turning ideas into interfaces and products. I\'ve also added a focus on my ability to work across different stages of product development. The focus now is on creating content for the selected work section.\n\n\n**Structuring Portfolio Content**\n\nI\'ve organized the portfolio content with dedicated sections for both client work and personal product experiments. I\'ve designed a clear filtering system using tabs and created a deep-dive case study structure. My \"About\" section headline is \"Building from Africa, thinking globally.\" and the \"Capabilities\" section details the technologies I am working with.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built a world-class personal portfolio website for **Hassan Abdulsatar Olamide**.\n\n### Key Features & Design System\n\n- **Editorial Technology Aesthetic**: Framed by a high-contrast dark canvas (`#0A0A0A` / `#121212`), high-density typography (Syne headings + Plus Jakarta Sans + Space Mono), grid layout structures, and generous whitespace.\n- **Brand System & Distinction**: Establishes **Hassan Abdulsatar Olamide** as a *Product Builder, Full-Stack Developer, and Founder*, while cleanly positioning **NAMACO TECHNOLOGY NIGERIA LIMITED** as his umbrella technology brand identity rather than a portfolio project. Includes the official NAMACO logo mark.\n- **Editorial Navigation**: Refined sticky header navigation (`WORK`, `ABOUT`, `CAPABILITIES`, `CONTACT`, `LET\'S CONNECT`) with a slide-down mobile menu overlay.\n- **Hero & Positioning**: Oversized typography displaying Hassan\'s identity, primary headline *\"I build digital products that move ideas forward.\"*, supporting copy, and the transition section *\"From idea to interface to product.\"*\n- **Selected Work**: Case-study cards for Hassan\'s core products and platforms:\n  - **01 VEYRA** (`PRODUCT \302\267 PLATFORM \302\267 FULL-STACK`) \342\200\224 Positioned around team building and co-builder discovery (`https://vetra-waitlist-azure.vercel.app/`).\n  - **02 DOERLY** (`STARTUP \302\267 PLATFORM \302\267 PRODUCT`) \342\200\224 Creative execution platform (`https://doerlyai.vercel.app/`).\n  - **03 TAHAB HOTEL & SUITES** (`CLIENT WORK \302\267 HOSPITALITY`) \342\200\224 Hospitality web experience (`https://tahab-hotel-demo.netlify.app/`).\n  - **04 SPLIT & SETTLE** (`WEB APP \302\267 PRODUCT EXPERIMENT`) \342\200\224 Group expense settlement utility (`https://v0-problem-solving-ideas.vercel.app/`).\n- **Interactive Case Study Deep Dives**: Full modal breakdown covering all 11 lifecycle phases (Overview, Problem, Product Vision, UX, Design, Architecture, Auth, Database, Deployment, Challenges, and Lessons Learned) with architecture diagrams and defensible metrics.\n- **Client & Business Work**: Separate category highlighting commercial work for *Quafix Plugs, Adeshina Gadget, K-Tech, Aby Gadgets, Softy Gadgets,* and *Hibee Computer Technology* with verified roles and contributions.\n- **Interactive Project Filtering**: Filter tabs (`ALL`, `PRODUCTS`, `CLIENT WORK`, `WEB APPS`, `EXPERIMENTS`).\n- **About & Philosophy**: Features *\"Building from Africa, thinking globally.\"*, Hassan\'s founder statement, principles, and personal portrait presentation.\n- **What I Build & Technology Stack**: Highlights 5 core capabilities (*Product, Frontend, Backend, Full-Stack, Experiments*) and verified technology stack (HTML, CSS, JS, React, Vite, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, Supabase, REST APIs, Auth, Git, GitHub, Vercel, Netlify).\n- **How I Build & Proof of Work**: Displays the 5-step engineering lifecycle (*Understand, Structure, Design, Build, Ship*) and an interactive code logic viewer showcasing real code snippets.\n- **Currently Building Spotlight**: Featured venture spotlight for Veyra under NAMACO.\n- **Contact & Footer**: Direct email (`olamideh825@gmail.com`), phone (`08051842700`), Instagram (`@namacotechnology`), primary mailto actions, interactive inquiry form, and footer copyright system."
    thinking_duration {
